{
  "destination": "mali",
  "forms": [
    {
      "kind": "evisa",
      "title": "Formulaire de demande de visa et autorisation d'entrée au Mali (Ministry of Foreign Affairs consular portal)",
      "appliesTo": [
        "embassy-tourist"
      ],
      "startUrl": "https://diplomatiemdc.gouv.ml/vitrine/",
      "readOn": "2026-10-07",
      "readAs": {
        "purpose": "Tourisme",
        "nationality": "Polonais/Polonaise",
        "passportType": "Ordinaire",
        "countryOfResidence": "Pologne",
        "placeOfSubmission": "Ambassade du Mali - Allemagne"
      },
      "requiresAccount": false,
      "stoppedAt": "Etape 1 of the application form (personal information). Etapes 2 to 7 were read from the form markup served with Etape 1; nothing was typed",
      "steps": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "name": "Venir au Mali pour : Tourisme (visa check)",
          "read": true,
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "nationalite",
              "label": "Nationalité",
              "type": "country",
              "required": null,
              "options": [
                "<countries>"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "type_passport",
              "label": "Type de passeport",
              "type": "select",
              "required": null
            },
            {
              "name": "pays_residence",
              "label": "Pays de résidence",
              "type": "country",
              "required": null,
              "options": [
                "<countries>"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "lieu_depot",
              "label": "Lieu de dépôt",
              "type": "select",
              "required": null,
              "notes": "Malian embassy or consulate that receives the application"
            }
          ],
          "notices": [
            "Un visa vous est requis pour voyager sur le territoire Malien. Cliquez sur OK pour commencer votre demande de visa."
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "name": "Contrôle du code de dossier",
          "read": true,
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "codeSession",
              "label": "code dossier",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            }
          ],
          "notices": [
            "Si vous possédez déjà un code de dossier, veuillez le saisir, puis cliquer sur \"Continuer\" pour poursuivre la transmission de votre demande de visa.",
            "* Le code n'est valable que 7 jours après sa génération *"
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "name": "Conditions d'entrée (Loi n° 04-058 du 25 novembre 2004)",
          "read": true,
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "exampleCheck1",
              "label": "J'ai lu et j'accepte les conditions générales d'entrée au Mali",
              "type": "checkbox",
              "required": true
            }
          ],
          "notices": [
            "Article 8: Entrer au Mali, tout etranger doit etre muni Du visa d'entrée; Des documents relatifs, d'une part à l'objet et aux conditions de séjour, et d'autre part, s'il y a lieu, à ses moyens d'existence et aux garanties de son rapatriement; Des documents nécessaires à l'exercice d'une activité proffessionnelle, s'il se propose d'exercer une activité professionnelle au Mali",
            "Article 9: L'accès au territoire malien peut etre refusé à tout étranger dont la présence peut constituer une menace pour l'ordre public ou qui fait objet, soit d'une interdiction de territoire, ou d'une décision expulsion."
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "name": "Etape 1 — Informations personnelles / Personal informations",
          "read": true,
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "nom",
              "label": "Nom/ Surname",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "prenom",
              "label": "Prénom/ First names",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "date_naiss",
              "label": "Date et lieu de naissance/ Date and place of birth",
              "type": "date",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "nationalite",
              "label": "Nationalité/ Nationality",
              "type": "country",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "<countries>"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "nationalite_naissance",
              "label": "Nationalité à la naissance/ Nationality at birth",
              "type": "country",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "<countries>"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "sexe",
              "label": "Sexe/ Sex",
              "type": "radio",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "M",
                "F"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "etat_civil",
              "label": "Etat civil/ Marital status",
              "type": "radio",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "Célibataire",
                "Marié(e)",
                "Divorcé(e)",
                "Veuf(ve)"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "num_identite",
              "label": "Numéro d’identité national/ National identity number",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "adresse_actuelle",
              "label": "Adresse actuelle/ Present address",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "tel",
              "label": "Téléphone/ Phone (Mobile)",
              "type": "tel",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "email",
              "label": "Email",
              "type": "email",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "titre_voyage1",
              "label": "Type de passeport/ Passport type",
              "type": "radio",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "Ordinaire",
                "Service",
                "Diplomatique",
                "Spécial",
                "Réfugiés",
                "Laissez passer Nations Unies",
                "Laissez passer Union Européenne",
                "Laissez passer Union Africaine",
                "Autres"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "profession",
              "label": "Profession/ Occupation",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "pj_professionnelle",
              "label": "Carte professionnelle/ Business card",
              "type": "file",
              "required": null
            },
            {
              "name": "pj_autorisation_voyage",
              "label": "Autorisation de voyager/ Authorization to travel",
              "type": "file",
              "required": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "name": "Etape 2 — Informations sur l'employeur ou établissement d’enseignement",
          "read": true,
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "name_employeur",
              "label": "Nom complet/ Full name",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "adresse_employeur",
              "label": "Adresse/ Address",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "tel_employeur",
              "label": "Téléphone/ Phone",
              "type": "tel",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "email_employeur",
              "label": "Email",
              "type": "email",
              "required": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "name": "Etape 3 — Autorité parentale (pour les mineurs)",
          "read": true,
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "name_parent",
              "label": "Nom complet/ Full name",
              "type": "text",
              "required": null
            },
            {
              "name": "adresse_parent",
              "label": "Adresse/ Address",
              "type": "text",
              "required": null
            },
            {
              "name": "tel_parent",
              "label": "Téléphone/ Phone",
              "type": "tel",
              "required": null
            },
            {
              "name": "email_parent",
              "label": "Email",
              "type": "email",
              "required": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 7,
          "name": "Etape 4 — Informations sur la personne ou organisation qui invite",
          "read": true,
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "type_invite",
              "label": "Avez-vous été invité par/ Have you been invited by:",
              "type": "radio",
              "required": null,
              "options": [
                "UNE ORGANISATION",
                "UNE PERSONNE"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "name_invite",
              "label": "Nom complet/ Full name",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "adresse_invite",
              "label": "Adresse/ Address",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "tel_invite",
              "label": "Téléphone/ Phone",
              "type": "tel",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "email_invite",
              "label": "Email",
              "type": "email",
              "required": false
            },
            {
              "name": "name_contact",
              "label": "Contacts dans l'organisation/ Contact information in Organization",
              "type": "text",
              "required": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 8,
          "name": "Etape 5 — Informations sur le passeport",
          "read": true,
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "num_passeport",
              "label": "Numéro passeport/ Passport number",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "date_delivrance",
              "label": "Date de delivrance/ Date of issue",
              "type": "date",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "validite",
              "label": "Date d'expiration/ Validity",
              "type": "date",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "lieu_delivrance",
              "label": "Autorité de délivrance/ Issuing authority",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "date_precedent_sejour",
              "label": "Date et adresse du précedent séjour au Mali",
              "type": "date",
              "required": false
            },
            {
              "name": "num_vignette",
              "label": "Numéro du visa précedent/ Previous visa number",
              "type": "text",
              "required": false
            },
            {
              "name": "empreintes",
              "label": "Empreintes digitales relevées précédemment aux fins d’une demande de visa / Fingerprints previously collected for the purposes of Visa application",
              "type": "select",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "NON",
                "OUI"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 9,
          "name": "Etape 6 — Informations sur le visa",
          "read": true,
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "urgence_demande",
              "label": "Type de délivrance/ Type of delivery",
              "type": "radio",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "Normal",
                "Express"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "nbre_entre",
              "label": "Nombre d’entrées demandées/ Number of requested entries",
              "type": "select",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "Une entrée",
                "Deux entrées",
                "Entrées multiples"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "motif_change",
              "label": "Motif de sejour/ Reason of journey",
              "type": "select",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "Vaccances",
                "Professionnelle",
                "Affaires",
                "Tourisme",
                "Visite à la famille ou à des amis",
                "Culture",
                "Sports",
                "Visite officielle",
                "Raisons médicales",
                "Études",
                "Transit aéroportuaire",
                "Autres"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "info_sejour",
              "label": "Informations complémentaires sur l’objet du voyage/ Additional information on the purpose of the trip",
              "type": "textarea",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "lieu_sejour",
              "label": "Lieu de sejour/ Destination in",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "date_entre_sejour",
              "label": "Date d'entrée souhaitée/ Effective date of entry",
              "type": "date",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "indication_lieu_sejour",
              "label": "Voie d'entrée au Mali/ Entrance route in Mali",
              "type": "radio",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "Terrestre",
                "Aérienne"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "date_sortie_sejour",
              "label": "Date de sortie prévue/ Expected release date",
              "type": "date",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "duree_sejour",
              "label": "Durée du séjour/ Duration of stay",
              "type": "select",
              "required": true,
              "options": [
                "3 MOIS",
                "6 MOIS"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "lieu_destination_apres_mali",
              "label": "Lieu de destination en sortant du Mali/ Destination after leaving Mali",
              "type": "country",
              "required": false,
              "options": [
                "<countries>"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "garantie_rapatriement",
              "label": "Garantie de rapatriement/ Return garantee",
              "type": "select",
              "required": false,
              "options": [
                "NON",
                "OUI"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 10,
          "name": "Etape 7 — Date souhaitée pour le rendez-vous",
          "read": true,
          "fields": [
            {
              "label": "DATE SOUHAITEE POUR LE RENDEZ-VOUS",
              "type": "date",
              "required": null
            }
          ]
        }
